    "description": "Example module file with observations. The blood pressure ranges are Synthea's own configuration (src/main/resources/biometrics.yml, metabolic.blood_pressure.normal), not a clinical norm: BloodPressureValueGenerator draws a baseline from them and then adds medication, lifestyle and a 12-hour variation, so recorded values can fall outside them. The medications are the four that medications/hypertension_medication.json prescribes, each measured among the patients with hypertension active at the reference date. The file gives no expected prevalence, incidence or medication share."
